# Seeds — small, static reference data checked into version control.
#
# Nothing here is generated. MetaBridge does not invent seeds: the IR carries
# no signal that separates a static lookup table from any other relation, and
# guessing would put fabricated data into your project.
#
# What DOES point here: anything the lineage report lists under "Unmanaged
# relations" — a relation this project reads but neither builds nor declares
# as a source. A small, rarely-changing one is a seed candidate; a large or
# live one belongs in the source manifest instead.
#
# seeds:
#   - name: <file>                # <file>.csv, beside this file
#     description: ""
#     columns:
#       - name: <column>
